1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,500
@CityScene
[Narrator] A peaceful city afternoon.

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:07,000
@CityScene
[Narrator] Suddenly, the ground shakes. {Camera:MonsterStomp|intensity=0.4}

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:10,500
@DestroyedCityScene
[Narrator] From beneath the earth emerges the ancient monster, Gabura!

4
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:14,000
@DestroyedCityScene
[Narrator] Buildings crumble as the beast roars its challenge.

5
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:17,500
@DestroyedCityScene
[Narrator] The Science Special Search Party scrambles to evacuate civilians.

6
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:21,000
@DestroyedCityScene
[Narrator] But human weapons are useless against the monster's armored hide.

7
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:25,000
@CityScene
[Narrator] Just as hope fades, a red light streaks across the sky.

8
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:28,500
@CityScene
[Narrator] A silver giant descends from the heavens! {Animation:HeroLanding}

9
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:32,000
@CityScene
[Narrator] Ultraman! The warrior of light has come to defend Earth! {Camera:HeroReveal} {Animation:FightingStance}

10
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:36,000
@DestroyedCityScene
[Narrator] Gabura charges! The battle for the city begins!

11
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:40,000
@DestroyedCityScene
[Narrator] Ultraman meets the beast head-on!

12
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:44,000
@DestroyedCityScene
[Narrator] The two titans grapple, shaking the very foundations of the city!

13
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:48,000
@DestroyedCityScene
[Narrator] Ultraman throws Gabura! The monster crashes through a building!

14
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:52,000
@DestroyedCityScene
[Narrator] Gabura rises, enraged! It unleashes its fiery breath!

15
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:56,000
@DestroyedCityScene
[Narrator] Ultraman raises his arms, deflecting the flames!

16
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:00,000
@DestroyedCityScene
[Narrator] The Color Timer begins to blink! Ultraman's time on Earth is limited!

17
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:04,000
@DestroyedCityScene
[Narrator] He must end this quickly! Ultraman crosses his arms!

18
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:08,000
@DestroyedCityScene
[Narrator] Spacium Beam! The legendary ray of light! {Animation:UltraBeam} {Camera:BeamFollow}

19
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:12,000
@DestroyedCityScene
[Narrator] The beam strikes true! Gabura staggers!

20
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:16,000
@DestroyedCityScene
[Narrator] One final strike! Ultraman's fist glows with cosmic energy!

21
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:20,000
@DestroyedCityScene
[Narrator] The monster falls! Gabura is defeated!

22
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:26,000
@CityScene
[Narrator] Ultraman watches the city, then soars into the sky. {Animation:FlyAway}

23
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:32,000
@CityScene
[Narrator] The warrior of light departs, leaving peace behind.

24
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:40,000
@SkyScene
[Narrator] Until the next threat rises... Ultraman will return!
